WEBVTT

00:20.020 --> 00:21.980
So this is the place?

00:22.981 --> 00:23.815
Yeah.

00:27.152 --> 00:29.446
Seeing this place in person
makes me nervous.

00:30.822 --> 00:31.865
Those Union punks

00:33.324 --> 00:34.993
will seriously outnumber us too.

00:37.037 --> 00:37.871
Hey, kid.

00:38.913 --> 00:40.915
Why worry when you have me?

00:41.416 --> 00:44.127
I don't care how many there are.
Those punks are dead meat.

00:45.170 --> 00:48.298
Hey, you fucking idiot.
You can't beat them by yourself.

00:49.883 --> 00:51.259
Let's push the date out.

00:52.469 --> 00:53.595
What?

00:54.846 --> 00:57.974
We need time to prepare if we want to win.

01:02.520 --> 01:03.438
Who's the person

01:05.356 --> 01:07.525
Na Baek-jin trusts most in the Union?

01:18.244 --> 01:19.120
Hey.

01:20.080 --> 01:20.914
Back then,

01:21.998 --> 01:25.085
when you fucking stabbed my foot,

01:27.003 --> 01:28.963
I had to get a tetanus shot.

01:31.174 --> 01:33.510
I'm sorry about that.

01:37.222 --> 01:39.015
Aren't you fucking sentimental?

01:40.350 --> 01:41.392
Anyway,

01:43.019 --> 01:44.354
your theory is

01:45.647 --> 01:48.525
that the Union has a burner account,

01:49.984 --> 01:51.778
and I have access to it.

01:52.821 --> 01:54.864
And you want me to give it to you?

01:58.409 --> 02:00.995
Well, what the fuck do I get out of this?

02:02.455 --> 02:04.624
You could take the blame for everything.

02:05.917 --> 02:09.879
If the Union collapses,
the evidence of their crimes disappears.

02:11.297 --> 02:12.882
Wouldn't that benefit you?

02:16.636 --> 02:19.180
I knew it when I first saw you.

02:19.264 --> 02:20.974
You're a fucking lunatic.

02:24.060 --> 02:24.978
Okay.

02:26.813 --> 02:27.647
Deal.

02:37.407 --> 02:38.324
Where are you going?

02:42.203 --> 02:43.163
I need to study

02:44.372 --> 02:46.666
the Union and Na Baek-jin.

02:56.259 --> 03:00.555
EUNJANG (UNKNOWN) VS UNION (300 PEOPLE?)
EUNJANG IS OUTNUMBERED, MUST DIVIDE UNION

03:05.393 --> 03:10.023
CONVERT INSIDER: CHOI HYO-MAN

03:11.441 --> 03:12.275
Choi Hyo-man.

03:14.152 --> 03:15.278
I need your help.

03:18.156 --> 03:20.658
Here is the evidence I got from Seong-je.

03:22.452 --> 03:24.162
Spread this to the Union members.

03:24.245 --> 03:27.081
NOV 19, BAEK DONG-HA, 3,115,000 WON
NOV 18, KWON HYEOK-JIN, 2,250,000 WON

03:27.165 --> 03:27.999
Look at this.

03:28.791 --> 03:30.126
- We might be fucked.
- What?

03:30.210 --> 03:32.170
- Na Baek-jin took the money.
- What?

03:32.253 --> 03:33.671
Fucking crazy punks.

03:33.755 --> 03:35.131
Shit.

03:35.215 --> 03:36.216
Hey, fuck this.

03:36.299 --> 03:37.300
Is this real?

03:37.967 --> 03:39.135
It's like you said.

03:40.178 --> 03:41.596
The Union is kept together by money.

03:41.679 --> 03:42.931
HE TOOK 100 MIL

03:43.014 --> 03:45.308
Hey, it looks like Baek-jin
took the money and ran.

03:45.391 --> 03:46.392
Let me see, dumbass.

03:47.518 --> 03:48.978
Hey, he took the money and ran.

03:49.437 --> 03:50.605
HYO-MAN:
YOU MORONS

03:50.688 --> 03:52.482
- Man, I'm fucking jealous.
- Fuck my life.

03:53.316 --> 03:54.484
What the fuck is this?

03:54.567 --> 03:56.110
Money brought them together.

03:57.237 --> 03:59.239
Money can easily break them apart.

04:01.074 --> 04:01.908
So…

04:02.575 --> 04:03.993
HYO-MAN:
WE COULD GET FUCKED FOR THIS

04:04.077 --> 04:05.495
…do what you're good at.

04:25.598 --> 04:29.102
Do you really think jumping rope
will help you get stronger?

04:29.644 --> 04:31.521
You've got bad knees already, man.

04:36.025 --> 04:38.111
I have to do something, you punk.

04:41.072 --> 04:43.324
You think too much, man.

04:49.330 --> 04:51.165
You're the one who thinks too much.

04:52.417 --> 04:53.251
What?

04:55.044 --> 04:56.421
You're worried about him.

04:58.131 --> 04:59.090
Na Baek-jin.

05:06.014 --> 05:08.224
Whoa. Hey, is this your place?

05:09.934 --> 05:10.768
Yeah.

05:10.852 --> 05:13.521
Wow. It's freaking huge and fancy.

05:14.689 --> 05:16.774
My house is a speck of dust next to this.

05:20.236 --> 05:22.113
Hey, a basketball hoop.

05:23.239 --> 05:24.449
You can play, right?

05:29.245 --> 05:30.705
The loser buys drinks.

05:31.998 --> 05:33.708
What are you doing? Hurry up!

05:54.562 --> 05:58.107
The padded jackets you sent for the kids.

06:00.026 --> 06:00.985
Thank you.

06:02.320 --> 06:03.988
They were really happy.

06:06.699 --> 06:07.658
I'm glad.

06:12.330 --> 06:13.373
Baek-jin.

06:17.043 --> 06:17.960
Every month,

06:18.878 --> 06:21.005
you send gifts and donations.

06:23.257 --> 06:24.801
You don't need to do that.

06:26.719 --> 06:27.929
Until now,

06:28.805 --> 06:31.349
I haven't asked where the money came from.

06:32.600 --> 06:34.685
But I'm starting to get worried.

06:44.112 --> 06:45.780
I'll rest up a bit before I go.

07:08.344 --> 07:11.222
WEAK HERO:
CLASS 2

08:59.830 --> 09:00.748
Is this everyone?

09:00.831 --> 09:03.084
No idea. Those assholes all bailed.

09:04.335 --> 09:08.714
You know, some of the boys said
our burner account got exposed.

09:10.800 --> 09:12.635
Is everything okay with us?

09:17.265 --> 09:18.391
Yeon Si-eun.

09:32.572 --> 09:35.908
SEONG-JE: THE EVIDENCE AGAINST NA BAEK-JIN
SEEMS TO BE IN THE UNION OFFICE

09:35.992 --> 09:38.452
LET'S GRAB IT NOW WHILE IT'S EMPTY

09:58.723 --> 10:00.057
Hey, boys!

10:08.274 --> 10:09.150
Hey.

10:09.775 --> 10:11.360
The weather fucking sucks, huh?

10:12.278 --> 10:14.113
You should have checked the weather.

10:14.196 --> 10:15.948
My shoes are getting wet.

10:16.032 --> 10:19.493
Hey, water sports are
always more fun, you punk.

10:21.329 --> 10:22.246
Let's go!

10:27.627 --> 10:28.586
Where's Si-eun?

10:28.669 --> 10:29.754
His phone is busy.

10:30.379 --> 10:31.255
Really?

10:32.548 --> 10:34.425
He must have met up with Baku first.

10:37.386 --> 10:40.556
- EUNJANG HIGH, LET'S GO
- BAKU-

10:40.640 --> 10:42.558
Hey! Why didn't you come sooner?

10:43.976 --> 10:45.978
You've got to take this more seriously.

10:47.438 --> 10:48.272
Well…

10:49.565 --> 10:53.861
Are you ready to smash
these Union punks or what?

10:55.196 --> 10:56.781
Seriously, what's your deal?

10:57.281 --> 11:00.159
Last time, you were trying
to sell off Eunjang to the Union.

11:00.743 --> 11:03.537
- Decided to fix your reputation?
- What's this bullshit?

11:03.621 --> 11:08.292
The other day, Yeon Si-eun
asked for my help, just this one time.

11:09.335 --> 11:11.003
But I never forgave you.

11:15.216 --> 11:16.175
I won't forgive…

11:18.636 --> 11:21.263
all the wrongs you did to us.

11:22.807 --> 11:24.100
The ways you bullied us.

11:25.142 --> 11:26.394
I don't forgive you.

11:30.022 --> 11:31.941
But right now, we need you.

11:42.201 --> 11:43.160
Let's go.

11:44.620 --> 11:45.454
Damn.

11:48.916 --> 11:49.750
Let's go.

12:00.052 --> 12:01.011
Shit.

12:10.771 --> 12:13.107
What's going on? Why are you so early?

12:14.191 --> 12:15.484
It's not that urgent.

12:22.074 --> 12:23.159
Shit.

12:32.293 --> 12:33.919
This is our burner phone.

12:34.503 --> 12:36.464
All the transactions are on the app here.

12:36.964 --> 12:38.466
This is the original.

12:39.925 --> 12:42.636
You'll need something big like this
to finish Baek-jin.

12:48.976 --> 12:50.770
Why are you trying so hard?

12:57.443 --> 13:01.155
If you don't want anyone else hurt,
you'll have to be the one that does.

13:04.575 --> 13:05.534
Relax.

13:07.036 --> 13:07.870
Relax.

13:07.953 --> 13:09.747
You know, it was weird.

13:11.874 --> 13:13.876
It felt like I became a good guy.

13:16.295 --> 13:18.506
But I just wanna have fun like this.

13:41.570 --> 13:42.404
There's Baku!

13:45.991 --> 13:48.202
You're so eager to fight
that you rushed over.

13:51.831 --> 13:54.166
Thanks a lot for coming.

14:02.883 --> 14:03.884
Where's Si-eun?

14:04.510 --> 14:05.344
What?

14:06.846 --> 14:09.557
His phone was busy,
so I thought he was with you.

14:15.271 --> 14:17.481
YEON SI-EUN:
I'M STOPPING BY THE BOWLING CLUB

14:17.565 --> 14:19.692
Si-eun went to the bowling club.

14:25.406 --> 14:29.952
The number you have dialed is unavailable.
Please leave a message after the…

14:30.035 --> 14:31.412
His phone is off.

14:32.037 --> 14:35.499
Shit. Do you think the Union punks
are pulling something?

14:37.877 --> 14:39.795
I'll go check the bowling club.

14:40.963 --> 14:42.882
You two should stay here.

14:44.800 --> 14:46.510
I'll do what I can.

14:51.849 --> 14:52.725
Please do.

14:53.517 --> 14:54.351
Okay.

16:06.799 --> 16:07.883
Na Baek-jin!

16:12.805 --> 16:14.181
If you lose today,

16:15.349 --> 16:17.059
that's the end of the Union.

16:18.310 --> 16:19.436
Understood?

16:24.108 --> 16:24.942
Kill them all.

16:32.282 --> 16:33.993
I'll take care of Na Baek-jin.

16:34.493 --> 16:36.328
You guys handle the rest.

16:41.208 --> 16:42.251
Okay!

16:46.380 --> 16:48.090
Let's go!

17:14.366 --> 17:15.534
Hey, fucker!

17:16.368 --> 17:17.202
You asshole!

18:12.800 --> 18:14.009
How the fuck do I do this?

18:17.971 --> 18:19.139
You fucking…

18:24.353 --> 18:27.397
Well, you're a fun little shit.

18:32.528 --> 18:33.362
Thank you.

18:49.169 --> 18:50.003
Si-eun!

18:50.879 --> 18:51.797
Are you okay?

18:53.215 --> 18:54.675
How did you get here?

18:56.301 --> 18:57.719
Let's get out of here first.

19:10.399 --> 19:13.443
Try that again,
and I'll kill you, you fucking moron!

19:13.527 --> 19:14.570
Son of a bitch!

19:15.154 --> 19:16.697
Hey, you're done, asshole.

19:56.945 --> 19:58.822
Jun-tae, are you okay?

20:00.949 --> 20:01.825
I'm fine.

20:03.577 --> 20:04.828
Hurry. Let's go.

20:13.045 --> 20:14.546
You go first. I'll follow.

20:16.215 --> 20:17.591
- Let's go to a hospital.
- No.

20:17.674 --> 20:19.468
No way. I'm really fine.

20:21.595 --> 20:22.512
You go ahead.

20:25.390 --> 20:26.433
You need to go

20:27.434 --> 20:29.686
and help the kids stop fighting.

21:02.552 --> 21:04.263
Just stay down.

21:04.346 --> 21:05.347
Fuck.

21:05.973 --> 21:09.601
Don't be fucking ridiculous, punk.

21:12.271 --> 21:13.105
Fucking hell.

21:51.310 --> 21:52.811
- Hey!
- Fucking asshole!

21:53.312 --> 21:54.396
Fucking asshole!

21:58.025 --> 21:59.067
Fucker. Really?

22:01.194 --> 22:03.155
You punk. Fucking asshole.

22:04.406 --> 22:05.240
Motherfucker!

22:06.575 --> 22:08.994
You jerk. Fucking asshole.

22:10.120 --> 22:11.913
Come on!

22:18.837 --> 22:20.297
You weak-ass shit!

22:20.380 --> 22:21.840
Stop coming at me!

23:47.217 --> 23:48.385
Hey, Baek-jin.

23:49.094 --> 23:50.429
You've improved a lot.

23:52.806 --> 23:54.850
But this is not why I taught you.

23:55.976 --> 23:56.852
Shit, man.

23:58.353 --> 23:59.688
Let me end this.

24:41.771 --> 24:42.856
It hurts, doesn't it?

25:50.924 --> 25:51.800
Baek-jin.

25:53.051 --> 25:54.052
Are you all right?

26:04.771 --> 26:07.816
Hey, why do you get
beaten up all the time?

26:12.445 --> 26:13.947
Hold your fists tightly.

26:15.740 --> 26:17.200
Don't look away.

27:59.678 --> 28:00.595
Hey!

28:01.721 --> 28:03.598
Na Baek-jin won!

28:05.642 --> 28:06.559
That's enough!

28:08.395 --> 28:10.271
It's all over, you punks!

28:10.355 --> 28:14.025
Fucking stop fighting! Baek-jin won!

28:14.567 --> 28:16.236
Na Baek-jin won!

28:28.540 --> 28:29.499
From now on…

28:35.880 --> 28:38.091
Eunjang is part of the Union.

28:42.429 --> 28:43.346
If you…

28:47.892 --> 28:50.103
cannot accept this decision…

28:53.732 --> 28:54.774
then step forward.

28:56.860 --> 28:57.736
Who's next?

28:59.028 --> 28:59.946
Fuck.

29:02.824 --> 29:05.452
Come out, you fucking assholes!

29:51.664 --> 29:52.957
Oh yeah, you.

29:56.127 --> 29:57.086
Yeon Si-eun.

30:07.806 --> 30:08.681
What's wrong?

30:11.726 --> 30:13.436
You've done a lot of talking.

30:14.646 --> 30:16.564
Are you too scared to actually fight?

30:21.069 --> 30:23.238
Right now, no one here is talking

30:24.405 --> 30:25.532
except for you.

30:44.217 --> 30:46.302
You fucking asshole.

31:49.949 --> 31:50.950
Nice job!

32:50.635 --> 32:51.511
Yeon Si-eun.

35:45.434 --> 35:47.770
You told Baku to go for my arms,
didn't you?

35:52.066 --> 35:53.192
Arms and then legs?

35:55.319 --> 35:56.654
What's your next move?

35:59.115 --> 36:02.243
How wide is the margin of error, asshole?

36:07.748 --> 36:08.583
We're in it.

36:10.418 --> 36:11.586
What?

36:13.671 --> 36:15.381
We're in my margin of error.

36:17.925 --> 36:20.094
Your limbs are done.

36:34.442 --> 36:36.027
If you happen to lose,

36:37.445 --> 36:38.321
I'll step in.

36:44.327 --> 36:45.244
Get back up.

36:46.662 --> 36:49.957
I'll hold out until then somehow.

37:50.935 --> 37:51.894
- Hey.
- We won.

38:05.658 --> 38:06.617
Baek-jin.

38:12.957 --> 38:14.125
I'm sorry.

38:19.922 --> 38:20.756
But…

38:25.052 --> 38:26.637
you should be sorry too.

38:52.872 --> 38:54.373
The fight

38:56.042 --> 38:57.251
is now over!

39:01.881 --> 39:03.716
Let's go!

39:03.799 --> 39:05.426
- Let's go!
- Nice job!

39:21.067 --> 39:22.735
Hey, that hurts!

39:23.402 --> 39:24.695
Let's go eat!

40:07.279 --> 40:08.531
Do you know who I fought?

40:13.619 --> 40:15.329
So what did I do then?

40:15.413 --> 40:18.332
I did a foot sweep and got him! For real!

40:21.627 --> 40:23.629
For crying out loud, listen to me!

40:25.714 --> 40:26.715
Jun-tae!

41:02.835 --> 41:05.754
We slept like crazy.

41:09.508 --> 41:13.554
It was as if we were
catching up on our sleep.

41:16.724 --> 41:18.893
You can't tease me about basketball now.

41:18.976 --> 41:20.352
Tell him that story.

41:20.436 --> 41:21.562
So embarrassing.

41:21.645 --> 41:24.023
It was just yesterday. Just one mistake.

41:24.106 --> 41:25.024
Hey!

41:25.649 --> 41:26.692
Yeon Si-eun!

41:32.448 --> 41:33.491
You slowpoke.

41:33.574 --> 41:37.786
And we became seniors.

41:39.497 --> 41:40.623
Hey, this photo looks great.

41:40.706 --> 41:43.125
CHOI HYO-MAN FOR STUDENT BODY PRESIDENT
THE TOUGH GUY WHO UNITED EUNJANG

41:46.629 --> 41:47.630
After that,

41:48.714 --> 41:51.383
there were rumors
that Na Baek-jin disappeared.

41:53.844 --> 41:55.679
No one had any idea…

41:58.933 --> 42:00.559
where he had gone.

42:03.562 --> 42:04.563
Will Na Baek-jin…

42:06.857 --> 42:08.526
now get the right answer

42:09.985 --> 42:12.196
to the question he had gotten wrong?

42:21.580 --> 42:23.999
Why are you so lost in thought?

42:31.257 --> 42:33.133
It was nothing.

42:37.179 --> 42:39.265
Man, the weather is nice.

42:40.057 --> 42:41.308
Peaceful.

42:41.392 --> 42:42.810
Why don't you pass it?

42:44.228 --> 42:45.646
That was close!

42:52.403 --> 42:53.237
Nice!

42:53.904 --> 42:54.738
Hello?

43:46.874 --> 43:47.708
Go on.

44:34.338 --> 44:35.464
How's it going?

44:46.433 --> 44:47.351
Good.

44:54.024 --> 44:55.359
Who are those guys?

45:01.198 --> 45:02.199
My friends.

45:13.961 --> 45:15.045
That's good to see.

46:27.785 --> 46:29.495
So you're Baek-jin's friend?

46:36.043 --> 46:36.877
Yes.

46:38.170 --> 46:39.588
Well, something like that.

46:53.393 --> 46:54.311
We need someone

46:55.479 --> 46:56.688
to replace Baek-jin.

46:58.315 --> 47:02.069
CHEONGANG

47:02.152 --> 47:04.988
Not for children's games
like this bowling club.

47:06.949 --> 47:08.492
Is it fun over there?

47:08.992 --> 47:12.120
Making money isn't fun. It's hard work.

47:19.336 --> 47:20.796
That's not very romantic.

47:31.723 --> 47:33.475
By the way. Baek-jin…

47:36.478 --> 47:37.771
Do you know where he is?

47:39.314 --> 47:41.191
I can't reach that fucking asshole.

47:42.568 --> 47:44.027
I don't know.

47:44.111 --> 47:45.612
I'm curious too.

47:53.161 --> 47:59.042
CHEONGANG

48:29.865 --> 48:34.870
THE LATE NA BAEK-JIN

52:52.919 --> 52:57.924
Subtitle translation by: James Webb
